{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1787198872604,"sessionID":"ses_fe2a8999bffe7NeHXJfj0qzRM7","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_0744f5472f8a4b8483a0aa95","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"# Deep Research Dashboard — ds-flash-min lineage\n\n## Session\n- Lineage: fanout-ds-flash-min-1787198541887-w6k53d\n- Mode: research (cli-opencode, cline-pass/cline-pass/deepseek-v4-flash)\n- Status: complete | Stop reason: max_iterations\n\n## Lifecycle\n- generation: 1\n- lineageMode: new\n- archivedPath: null\n\n## Iterations\n| run | focus | newInfoRatio | findings count | status |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Load-bearing check identification and frozen-candidate contract under authority-state failure | 1.0 | 5 | complete |\n\n## Question Status\n- Answered: 1/4\n- Answered: \"Which check is load-bearing for the PASS verdict?\"\n- Remaining:\n  - \"What does the authority-state failure expose about the frozen-candidate contract?\" (implicitly addressed but not formally closed)\n  - \"Under the gate's own falsifiability requirement, which check demonstrated it can fail?\"\n  - \"Is not-run an admissible verdict outcome, or must every PASS require every authoritative check to have executed?\"\n\n## Trend\n- Last 3 newInfoRatio: 1.0 (n/a for single iteration)\n\n## Dead Ends (ruled out)\n| Approach | Reason | Iteration |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| authority-state module-resolution as semantic disagreement | Compiled registry .js artifact absent; not a state conflict | 1 |\n| fanout-real-run forcing FAIL | Defers to already-determined verdict | 1 |\n\n## Next Focus\nConfirm whether the two `not-run` checks would convert a would-be PASS into `not-run` (vacuity guard), and whether REQ-006 alone forbids a vacuous PASS or whether the enumerated set needs an explicit \"required for PASS\" marker.\n\n## Active Risks\n- `authority-state` reader cannot load `authority-registry.js` (missing compiled artifact) — P1, blocks REQ-008 read.\n- `not-run` vacuity guard is implicit (REQ-006), not structurally enforced per-check.","filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/022-012-runtime-enablement-build/specs/system-deep-loop/036-deep-loop-innovation/012-runtime-enablement/005-whole-system-gate/scratch/fanout-proof/research/lineages/ds-flash-min/deep-research-dashboard.md"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/022-012-runtime-enablement-build/specs/system-deep-loop/036-deep-loop-innovation/012-runtime-enablement/005-whole-system-gate/scratch/fanout-proof/research/lineages/ds-flash-min/deep-research-dashboard.md","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"specs/system-deep-loop/036-deep-loop-innovation/012-runtime-enablement/005-whole-system-gate/scratch/fanout-proof/research/lineages/ds-flash-min/deep-research-dashboard.md","time":{"start":1787198872598,"end":1787198872603}},"id":"prt_01d5a8ed3001z3ftwFEQW6xJMo","sessionID":"ses_fe2a8999bffe7NeHXJfj0qzRM7","messageID":"msg_01d5a7981001HBFFLSfCn5fqIi"}}
